		<profileDesc>
			<abstract>
				<p>This paper presents an autonomous ground robot architecture designed to assist first responders in indoor search and rescue operations during structural fires. We validate localization in zero-visibility smoke environments using combined thermal and LiDAR SLAM.</p>
			</abstract>
		</profileDesc>
