	<text xml:lang="en">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>Indoor structural firefighting presents extreme thermal and perceptual challenges for personnel. Previous work in swarm robotics demonstrated decentralized mapping in degraded environments <ref type="bibr" target="#b0">(Penders et al., 2018)</ref>. Modern infrared sensor fusion provides robust penetration through dense particulate suspensions <ref type="bibr" target="#b1">(Talavera, 2021)</ref>.</p>
			</div>
